## Interface: 16001
## Title: ProfitCraft
## Notes: Finds the most profitable things to buy, craft, disenchant and sell, and walks you through them one press at a time. Glows your best crafts in the profession window, at trainers, in What's Training and on AH recipes; adds Profit and Plays tabs to the AH. Prices from Auctionator, sale rates from TradeSkillMaster.
## Version: 2.0.0
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, TradeSkillMaster, WhatsTraining
## SavedVariables: ProfitCraftDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ProfitCraftCharDB
